(7780116, 1294191, 122678, '<td valign="top">
I do know Ira, he and his wife are new friends and play Bocce Ball with Barron my husband. Ira is an amazing woodworking artist. He is working on a WWII ship for over 25 years that is so incredibly amazing in every detail. It was too big in the space it was in for me to be able to photograph it with the dignity it deserved. Ira is the kindest man and most of his work is for donations family and friends. He has a talent that is a gift of making wood into art. I couldn''t be happier for Ira, this ribbon that is a tribute to his life and his work. 
<br/>Thank you for your kind notice of his portrait.
<br/></td>', 'I do know Ira, he and his wife are new friends and play Bocce Ball with Barron my husband. Ira is an amazing woodworking artist. He is working on a WWII ship for over 25 years that is so incredibly amazing in every detail. It was too big in the space it was in for me to be able to photograph it with the dignity it deserved. Ira is the kindest man and most of his work is for donations family and friends. He has a talent that is a gift of making wood into art. I couldn''t be happier for Ira, this ribbon that is a tribute to his life and his work. 
Thank you for your kind notice of his portrait.', '2025-04-28 08:29:21.000000', NULL, 0),
